[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Hello and welcome to Real Easy English,",
    "start": 0.03,
    "end": 3.671,
    "zh": "大家好,欢迎收听《Real Easy English》,"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "the podcast where we have real conversations",
    "start": 3.651,
    "end": 6.992,
    "zh": "这是一档我们用简单英语"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "in easy English",
    "start": 6.652,
    "end": 8.273,
    "zh": "进行真实对话的播客,"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "to help you learn.",
    "start": 8.053,
    "end": 9.293,
    "zh": "帮助你学习。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "I'm Beth.",
    "start": 9.193,
    "end": 10.113,
    "zh": "我是Beth。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "And I'm Neil.",
    "start": 9.953,
    "end": 11.194,
    "zh": "我是Neil。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "You can watch this podcast and test yourself with a worksheet,",
    "start": 11.254,
    "end": 15.395,
    "zh": "你可以观看这期播客,并用练习题自测,"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "which you can get free on our website",
    "start": 14.995,
    "end": 17.516,
    "zh": "你可以在我们的网站上免费获取,"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "at bbclearningenglish.com.",
    "start": 17.136,
    "end": 19.776,
    "zh": "网址是bbclearningenglish.com。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "So, Neil, how are you today?",
    "start": 24.638,
    "end": 27.699,
    "zh": "那么,Neil,你今天怎么样?"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "I’m very well actually.",
    "start": 27.919,
    "end": 29.3,
    "zh": "我其实感觉很好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "How are you feeling about our recording today?",
    "start": 28.9,
    "end": 32.081,
    "zh": "你对我们今天的录制感觉如何?"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Feeling confident ?",
    "start": 31.681,
    "end": 33.481,
    "zh": "感觉自信吗?"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "I’m feeling confident .",
    "start": 33.081,
    "end": 34.942,
    "zh": "我感觉很自信。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "Are you feeling nervous?",
    "start": 34.542,
    "end": 36.202,
    "zh": "你感觉紧张吗?"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Not at all, no.",
    "start": 36.102,
    "end": 37.282,
    "zh": "完全不紧张。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "I'm feeling confident .",
    "start": 36.902,
    "end": 38.783,
    "zh": "我感觉很自信。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "Well, today we're talking all about confidence.",
    "start": 38.383,
    "end": 42.324,
    "zh": "好,今天我们要聊的就是自信。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "So, listeners might be familiar",
    "start": 42.304,
    "end": 44.705,
    "zh": "听众们可能已经熟悉"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "with the adjective confident ,",
    "start": 44.365,
    "end": 46.986,
    "zh": "形容词confident,"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "which means being certain about something.",
    "start": 46.586,
    "end": 49.326,
    "zh": "意思是对某事很确定。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "Feeling good about yourself.",
    "start": 48.926,
    "end": 50.647,
    "zh": "对自己感觉良好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "But confidence is the noun,",
    "start": 51.427,
    "end": 53.788,
    "zh": "但confidence是名词,"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "and it's that feeling of being certain,",
    "start": 53.948,
    "end": 57.589,
    "zh": "指的是那种确定的感觉,"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "maybe about your own abilities or about a situation.",
    "start": 57.21,
    "end": 61.231,
    "zh": "可能是对自己能力或某种情况的确定。"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "OK, that's a good description, Beth.",
    "start": 61.311,
    "end": 64.672,
    "zh": "好,这个解释不错,Beth。"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "Would you say you are a confident person?",
    "start": 64.592,
    "end": 67.073,
    "zh": "你会说自己是个自信的人吗?"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "I think it really depends",
    "start": 66.673,
    "end": 70.074,
    "zh": "我觉得这真的要看"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "on the situation.",
    "start": 69.754,
    "end": 71.194,
    "zh": "具体情况。"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "text": "So if I am speaking with you like this,",
    "start": 72.615,
    "end": 77.976,
    "zh": "比如像现在这样和你说话,"
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "text": "I'm very confiden t, I know you.",
    "start": 77.796,
    "end": 80.477,
    "zh": "我就很自信,因为我了解你。"
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "text": "But if I'm around people that I don't know as much,",
    "start": 80.757,
    "end": 84.298,
    "zh": "但如果我身边是不太熟悉的人,"
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "text": "then I usually feel a bit more shy .",
    "start": 84.419,
    "end": 88.28,
    "zh": "我通常会感觉更害羞一些。"
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "text": "Yeah.",
    "start": 87.88,
    "end": 88.6,
    "zh": "是啊。"
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "text": "What about you?",
    "start": 88.38,
    "end": 89.34,
    "zh": "那你呢?"
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "text": "Are you generally confident ?",
    "start": 88.94,
    "end": 91.296,
    "zh": "你一般来说自信吗?"
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "text": "I think like you, if I think I know",
    "start": 91.296,
    "end": 95.082,
    "zh": "我觉得和你一样,如果我觉得自己"
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "text": "what I'm doing,",
    "start": 94.682,
    "end": 95.982,
    "zh": "知道自己在做什么,"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "text": "then I'm confident .",
    "start": 95.982,
    "end": 98.023,
    "zh": "那我就会自信。"
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "text": "But if I'm doing something,",
    "start": 97.623,
    "end": 100.004,
    "zh": "但如果我在做某件事,"
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "text": "especially with people",
    "start": 99.604,
    "end": 101.524,
    "zh": "尤其是身边有"
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "text": "who maybe know more about that thing than I do,",
    "start": 101.444,
    "end": 105.806,
    "zh": "比我更懂那件事的人,"
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "text": "then that can be nerve-racking ,",
    "start": 106.106,
    "end": 109.807,
    "zh": "那就会让人很紧张,"
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "text": "make you feel nervous, and then",
    "start": 109.407,
    "end": 112.108,
    "zh": "让你感到不安,然后"
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "text": "not be confident .",
    "start": 112.128,
    "end": 114.308,
    "zh": "就不那么自信了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "text": "Yeah, definitely.",
    "start": 113.908,
    "end": 115.149,
    "zh": "是的,确实如此。"
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "text": "I remember like being in a class,",
    "start": 114.749,
    "end": 119.11,
    "zh": "我记得曾经在课堂上,"
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "text": "in a classroom and if I feel like",
    "start": 119.05,
    "end": 122.951,
    "zh": "在教室里,如果我觉得"
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "text": "this topic is just,",
    "start": 122.551,
    "end": 124.412,
    "zh": "这个话题我完全不懂,"
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "text": "I don't know, then I would not feel confident at all.",
    "start": 124.012,
    "end": 128.473,
    "zh": "那我就会一点都不自信。"
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "text": "I'd definitely feel nervous.",
    "start": 128.233,
    "end": 129.833,
    "zh": "我肯定会感到紧张。"
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "text": "What other types of situations would make you feel shy or nervous?",
    "start": 129.674,
    "end": 134.055,
    "zh": "还有什么情况会让你感到害羞或紧张?"
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "text": "I think apart from meeting",
    "start": 133.655,
    "end": 137.616,
    "zh": "我觉得除了见"
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "text": "new people,",
    "start": 137.376,
    "end": 138.476,
    "zh": "陌生人之外,"
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "text": "I always feel a bit nervous with that,",
    "start": 138.076,
    "end": 140.837,
    "zh": "那总是会让我有点紧张,"
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "text": "I’m generally quite confident .",
    "start": 140.897,
    "end": 143.658,
    "zh": "其他时候我通常挺自信的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 56,
    "text": "So, if it comes to something",
    "start": 143.258,
    "end": 146.059,
    "zh": "比如说,"
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "text": "like public speaking",
    "start": 145.719,
    "end": 147.759,
    "zh": "像公开演讲这样的事,"
  },
  {
    "index": 58,
    "text": "where I have to talk in front of a lot of people,",
    "start": 147.86,
    "end": 150.78,
    "zh": "我要在很多人面前讲话,"
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "text": "if there are people I don't know,",
    "start": 151.461,
    "end": 153.541,
    "zh": "如果有我不认识的人在场,"
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "text": "I don't really have a problem.",
    "start": 153.141,
    "end": 156.923,
    "zh": "我基本上没问题。"
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "text": "I'm quite confident .",
    "start": 156.643,
    "end": 158.663,
    "zh": "我挺自信的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 62,
    "text": "But if I had to speak to a room of people",
    "start": 158.263,
    "end": 161.804,
    "zh": "但如果我要对一屋子人讲话,"
  },
  {
    "index": 63,
    "text": "and I know the people,",
    "start": 161.424,
    "end": 163.224,
    "zh": "而我又认识这些人,"
  },
  {
    "index": 64,
    "text": "that would make me more nervous.",
    "start": 163.645,
    "end": 165.625,
    "zh": "那反而会让我更紧张。"
  },
  {
    "index": 65,
    "text": "I don't know if that's weird.",
    "start": 165.225,
    "end": 167.786,
    "zh": "我不知道这算不算奇怪。"
  },
  {
    "index": 66,
    "text": "Maybe.",
    "start": 168.526,
    "end": 169.206,
    "zh": "也许吧。"
  },
  {
    "index": 67,
    "text": "I think I'm probably the opposite.",
    "start": 168.806,
    "end": 170.927,
    "zh": "我觉得我可能正好相反。"
  },
  {
    "index": 68,
    "text": "Really?",
    "start": 170.987,
    "end": 171.787,
    "zh": "真的吗?"
  },
  {
    "index": 69,
    "text": "If I talk to people I don't know,",
    "start": 172.148,
    "end": 174.308,
    "zh": "如果我和不认识的人说话,"
  },
  {
    "index": 70,
    "text": "I don't feel very confident",
    "start": 173.908,
    "end": 177.189,
    "zh": "我不会感觉很自信,"
  },
  {
    "index": 71,
    "text": "unless I'm very well prepared.",
    "start": 176.829,
    "end": 178.75,
    "zh": "除非我准备得很充分。"
  },
  {
    "index": 72,
    "text": "I think,",
    "start": 178.35,
    "end": 179.85,
    "zh": "我觉得,"
  },
  {
    "index": 73,
    "text": "being prepared is a good way to boost your confidence .",
    "start": 180.81,
    "end": 184.552,
    "zh": "充分准备是提升自信的好方法。"
  },
  {
    "index": 74,
    "text": "Yeah.",
    "start": 184.152,
    "end": 184.772,
    "zh": "是的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 75,
    "text": "I remember watching a video,",
    "start": 184.372,
    "end": 187.112,
    "zh": "我记得看过一个视频,"
  },
  {
    "index": 76,
    "text": "about a lady saying,",
    "start": 187.733,
    "end": 189.673,
    "zh": "一位女士说,"
  },
  {
    "index": 77,
    "text": "if you want to improve your confidence , to boost your confidence ,",
    "start": 189.313,
    "end": 193.394,
    "zh": "如果你想提升自信,增强自信心,"
  },
  {
    "index": 78,
    "text": "you should stand in a power stance",
    "start": 192.994,
    "end": 196.035,
    "zh": "你应该摆出一个power stance(power pose,力量姿势),"
  },
  {
    "index": 79,
    "text": "and think about all the good things that you're going to do,",
    "start": 196.276,
    "end": 200.537,
    "zh": "想想你将要做的所有美好事情,"
  },
  {
    "index": 80,
    "text": "and it will make you confident with your hands on your hips.",
    "start": 200.517,
    "end": 203.518,
    "zh": "这会让你双手叉腰时感觉更自信。"
  },
  {
    "index": 81,
    "text": "And she said, if you're going to do public speaking or something,",
    "start": 203.578,
    "end": 207.539,
    "zh": "她还说,如果你要进行公开演讲之类的事情,"
  },
  {
    "index": 82,
    "text": "that's, really can be quite scary,",
    "start": 207.139,
    "end": 210.16,
    "zh": "那真的会让人相当害怕,"
  },
  {
    "index": 83,
    "text": "she said, even just go to the toilet,",
    "start": 210.26,
    "end": 212.601,
    "zh": "她说,哪怕只是去趟洗手间,"
  },
  {
    "index": 84,
    "text": "stand in the toilet and do it on your own.",
    "start": 212.221,
    "end": 215.782,
    "zh": "站在洗手间里独自练习一下,"
  },
  {
    "index": 85,
    "text": "And apparently it increases your confidence .",
    "start": 215.682,
    "end": 218.843,
    "zh": "据说这样能增强你的自信心。"
  },
  {
    "index": 86,
    "text": "Well, I must try that.",
    "start": 218.443,
    "end": 220.423,
    "zh": "我一定要试试。"
  },
  {
    "index": 87,
    "text": "So, Neil, are there any situations",
    "start": 220.704,
    "end": 223.885,
    "zh": "那么,Neil,有没有什么情况"
  },
  {
    "index": 88,
    "text": "where you wish you were more confident ?",
    "start": 223.605,
    "end": 228.326,
    "zh": "是你希望自己更自信一些的?"
  },
  {
    "index": 89,
    "text": "Maybe.",
    "start": 227.926,
    "end": 228.646,
    "zh": "也许有。"
  },
  {
    "index": 90,
    "text": "I mean,",
    "start": 228.246,
    "end": 230.627,
    "zh": "我是说,"
  },
  {
    "index": 91,
    "text": "I have a lot of experience of driving, and I'm quite confident driving.",
    "start": 230.227,
    "end": 234.288,
    "zh": "我开车经验很丰富,开车时也很自信。"
  },
  {
    "index": 92,
    "text": "But driving abroad, driving,",
    "start": 233.888,
    "end": 236.589,
    "zh": "但是在国外开车,"
  },
  {
    "index": 93,
    "text": "especially in a foreign city,",
    "start": 236.229,
    "end": 238.81,
    "zh": "尤其是在陌生的城市开车,"
  },
  {
    "index": 94,
    "text": "can be nerve-racking .",
    "start": 239.17,
    "end": 243.171,
    "zh": "会让人相当紧张。"
  },
  {
    "index": 95,
    "text": "And yeah,",
    "start": 242.771,
    "end": 244.632,
    "zh": "是的,"
  },
  {
    "index": 96,
    "text": "I think it would be nice to be more confident",
    "start": 244.232,
    "end": 247.372,
    "zh": "我觉得如果在国外开车时能更自信一些就好了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 97,
    "text": "driving abroad.",
    "start": 247.193,
    "end": 249.093,
    "zh": "关于开车方面。"
  },
  {
    "index": 98,
    "text": "I was just thinking about language learning.",
    "start": 248.693,
    "end": 252.134,
    "zh": "我刚才在想学语言的事。"
  },
  {
    "index": 99,
    "text": "I wish I was more confident",
    "start": 251.734,
    "end": 255.195,
    "zh": "我希望自己能更自信一些,"
  },
  {
    "index": 100,
    "text": "when it came to speaking,",
    "start": 254.875,
    "end": 256.556,
    "zh": "尤其是在开口说话的时候,"
  },
  {
    "index": 101,
    "text": "but I feel so shy and nervous.",
    "start": 256.156,
    "end": 258.796,
    "zh": "但我总是感到很害羞、很紧张。"
  },
  {
    "index": 102,
    "text": "If I'm, unless I'm in, say, like a language class, then I'll be OK.",
    "start": 258.436,
    "end": 262.818,
    "zh": "如果我是在,比如说语言课堂上,那我还好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 103,
    "text": "But if I'm in the real world",
    "start": 262.598,
    "end": 264.898,
    "zh": "但如果是在现实世界中,"
  },
  {
    "index": 104,
    "text": "and I have to speak to someone in Spanish, for example,",
    "start": 264.498,
    "end": 267.559,
    "zh": "要用比如西班牙语和别人交流,"
  },
  {
    "index": 105,
    "text": "I get really nervous.",
    "start": 267.159,
    "end": 270.28,
    "zh": "我就会特别紧张。"
  },
  {
    "index": 106,
    "text": "I have so much respect for people like",
    "start": 269.88,
    "end": 273.681,
    "zh": "我非常敬佩像"
  },
  {
    "index": 107,
    "text": "our audience",
    "start": 273.281,
    "end": 274.441,
    "zh": "我们听众这样的人,"
  },
  {
    "index": 108,
    "text": "because they speak a foreign language,",
    "start": 274.041,
    "end": 277.142,
    "zh": "因为他们会说外语,"
  },
  {
    "index": 109,
    "text": "and that's a really hard thing to do.",
    "start": 276.742,
    "end": 279.323,
    "zh": "那真的是一件很难做到的事。"
  },
  {
    "index": 110,
    "text": "Nerve-racking .",
    "start": 279.103,
    "end": 280.323,
    "zh": "很让人紧张。"
  },
  {
    "index": 111,
    "text": "You need confidence .",
    "start": 279.923,
    "end": 281.884,
    "zh": "你需要自信。"
  },
  {
    "index": 112,
    "text": "And, you know, well done to you.",
    "start": 281.484,
    "end": 284.405,
    "zh": "所以,真的,做得好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 113,
    "text": "Because, because it's not easy.",
    "start": 284.125,
    "end": 286.345,
    "zh": "因为,因为这并不容易。"
  },
  {
    "index": 114,
    "text": "It's not easy at all.",
    "start": 285.985,
    "end": 287.486,
    "zh": "一点也不容易。"
  },
  {
    "index": 115,
    "text": "We heard the word shy ,",
